024 - Every Star Shall Sing a Carol
 / 
Key: Bb
Time: 4/4
Tempo: Moderato
Number: 24
Topic: Worship - 

Verse 1:
[Gm]Every [Adim]star [Cm/G]shall [Bb/F]sing [Dm]acarol;
